    "title": "Campaign level 4 at normal speed, pp1Roles on",
    "description": "The experiment half of the full-roster pair: campaign level 4, seed 1, the scripted player, with issue #358's PP1 role-first ordnance matrix applied (?pp1Roles=1). Level 4 is the first campaign board holding every kind the arm touches (brown, grey, teal, olive and green), which is why the pair for issue #720 is shot here as well as on level 1. The whole round at wall-clock pace under a 60 s ceiling, recorded from the compositor and resampled to 30 fps.",
    "altText": "One round of the scripted player against level 4's full roster under the PP1 role budgets, seen from the game camera."
  },
